<title>USA: X-Rite to buy Light Source Computer assets.</title>
<headline>X-Rite to buy Light Source Computer assets.</headline>
<dateline>GRANDVILLE, Mich. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>X-Rite Inc said Wedneday it agreed in principle to acquire the assets of Light Source Computer Images Inc, a privately held, San Rafael, Calif.-based producer of scanning, imaging and print optimization software.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>X-Rite manufactures quality control instruments.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
